Aerie-Purpose: Include the Aerie Guard strings (the tooltip, the accessible name and the menu of the address bar icon) in the browser's string resources.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/app/generated_resources.grd, chrome/app/generated_resources.grd.gritdeps
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #99. The messages are in chrome/browser/ui/views/aerie_adblock/aerie_guard_strings.grdp
(overlay). Same shape as services/0006 does for aerie_services_strings.grdp. It needs
onboarding/0001 and services/0006 (they add the lines this patch sits between), so the
series lists it after them.

--- a/chrome/app/generated_resources.grd
+++ b/chrome/app/generated_resources.grd
@@ -293,4 +293,7 @@
       <part file="aerie_services_strings.grdp" />
 
+      <!-- Aerie Guard strings -->
+      <part file="../browser/ui/views/aerie_adblock/aerie_guard_strings.grdp" />
+
       <!-- Media live preview specific strings -->
       <part file="media_live_preview_strings.grdp" />
--- a/chrome/app/generated_resources.grd.gritdeps
+++ b/chrome/app/generated_resources.grd.gritdeps
@@ -110,3 +110,4 @@
 chrome/app/vr_strings.grdp
 chrome/app/whats_new_strings.grdp
+chrome/browser/ui/views/aerie_adblock/aerie_guard_strings.grdp
 components/aerie_onboarding/aerie_onboarding_strings.grdp
